# <English>Yes {sir/madam}, have you made any progress on it?</English>
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlga_village_elder_active_mission_1:village_elder_active_mission_2"
msgid "Ну как, {господин/госпожа}, получилось что-нибудь?"
